   Mercier, Stephanie and Micheletta, Jerome and Muller, Martin and Notman,
   Hugh and Ouattara, Karim and Ostner, Julia and Pavelka, Mary S. M. and
   Peckre, Louise R. and Petersdorf, Megan and Quintero, Fredy and
   Ramos-Fernandez, Gabriel and Robbins, Martha M. and Salmi, Roberta and
   Schamberg, Isaac and Schuelke, Oliver and Semple, Stuart and Silk, Joan
   B. and Roberto Sosa-Lopez, J. and Torti, Valeria and Valente, Daria and
